			<td style="width: 1%; font-size: 9pt;">&#160;</td>
			<td style="width: 96%; font-size: 9pt;">
			<p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 9pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt;">Fee computed on table in exhibit required by Item 25(b) per Exchange Act Rules&#160;14a-6(i)(1)&#160;and&#160;0-11</p>
			</td>
		</tr>

</tbody></table>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>

