			<td colspan="3" style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; width: 57%; vertical-align: top;">In light of Mr. Francois's extensive background in financial services and the capital markets, the Board has concluded that Mr. Francois should be re-elected.</td>
