			<td colspan="3" style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; width: 57%; vertical-align: top;">In light of Mr. Kalha's deep financial expertise and experience as a seasoned public company director, the Board has concluded that Mr. Kalha should be re-elected.</td>
		</tr>
