			<td style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; width: 2%; text-align: justify; vertical-align: top;">&#8226;</td>
			<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; width: 75%; vertical-align: top;">Oversight of the qualifications, independence and performance of LGL Group's independent registered public accounting firm, including responsibility for the appointment, compensation, retention and oversight of the firm's work; and</td>
		</tr>
		<tr style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">
			<td style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; width: 20%; text-align: justify; border-right: 1px solid rgb(3, 79, 132);">&#160;</td>
			<td style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; width: 1%; text-align: justify;">&#160;</td>
			<td style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; width: 2%; text-align: justify;">&#160;</td>
