<div class="hf-row">
<div class="hf-cell TOCLink" style="display: inline-block; text-align: left;"><a href="#toc" style="font-weight: initial; font-style: initial; font-variant: initial; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt;">Table of Contents</a></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>

<p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt; text-align: left">&#160;</p>

<p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0pt; text-align: left;"><span style="color:#000000;"><b><a id="ExecutiveOfficers" title="ExecutiveOfficers" href="#"></a>Executive Officers</b></span></p>

<p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt; text-align: left;">&#160;</p>

<p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 3pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0pt;">The following individuals constitute our current executive officers:</p>

<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; width: 100%; margin-left: 0pt; margin-right: 0pt; margin-bottom: 3pt;">

		<tbody><tr style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">
			<td style="width: 47%; padding: 0px 0px 5px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;"><b>Name</b></td>
			<td style="width: 53%; padding: 0px 0px 5px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;"><b>Position</b></td>
		</tr>
		<tr style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">
			<td style="width: 47%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">Marc Gabelli <sup style="vertical-align:top;line-height:120%;">(1)</sup></td>
			<td style="width: 53%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">Executive Chairman</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td style="width: 47%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">Jason D. Lamb <sup style="vertical-align:top;line-height:120%;">(2)</sup></td>
			<td style="width: 53%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">Chief Executive Officer</td>
		</tr>
		<tr style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">
			<td style="width: 47%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">Linda Biles</td>
			<td style="width: 53%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">Vice President and Controller</td>
		</tr>
		<tr style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">
			<td style="width: 47%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">Tiffany Hayden</td>
			<td style="width: 53%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">Vice President</td>
		</tr>
		<tr style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">
			<td style="width: 47%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">Patrick Huvane</td>
			<td style="width: 53%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">Executive Vice President - Business Development</td>
		</tr>

</tbody></table>

<hr style="text-align: left; height: 1px; color: #000000; background-color: #000000; width: 10%; border: none; margin: 3pt auto 3pt 0"/>
<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%; text-indent: 0px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin: 3pt 0pt;">

		<tbody><tr style="vertical-align: top; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">
			<td style="width: 2%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">
			<p style="margin: 0pt; text-align: left; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 8pt;"><sup style="vertical-align:top;line-height:120%;">(1)</sup></p>
			</td>
			<td style="width: 98%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; vertical-align: middle;">
			<p style="margin: 0pt; text-align: left; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 8pt;">Mr. Gabelli served as&#160;principal executive officer and Chief Executive Officer&#160;from&#160;April 16, 2025 to January 5, 2026</p>
			</td>
		</tr>

</tbody></table>

<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%; text-indent: 0px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin: 3pt 0pt;">

		<tbody><tr style="vertical-align: top; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">
			<td style="width: 2%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">
			<p style="margin: 0pt; text-align: left; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 8pt;"><sup style="vertical-align:top;line-height:120%;">(2)</sup></p>
			</td>
			<td style="width: 98%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; vertical-align: middle;">
			<p style="margin: 0pt; text-align: left; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 8pt;">Mr. Lamb&#160;was appointed Chief Executive Officer&#160;on January 5, 2026</p>
			</td>
		</tr>

</tbody></table>

<p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt; text-align: left;">&#160;</p>

<p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt; text-align: left;">Biographical summaries, including age, education, and experience,&#160;of our current executive officers are set forth below.</p>

<p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt; text-align: left;">&#160;</p>

<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; width: 100%; margin-left: 0pt; margin-right: 0pt;">

		<tbody><tr style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">
			<td colspan="5" style="width: 47%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; padding: 5px 0px; border-top: 1px solid rgb(3, 79, 132); border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(3, 79, 132);"><span style="color: rgb(3, 79, 132); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;"><b>MARC GABELLI</b></span>, Executive Chairman</td>
		</tr>
