			<p style="margin: 0pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt;">Ms. Biles currently serves as Executive Vice President - Finance of M-tron Industries, Inc. (2024 to present) and Vice President &amp; Controller of The LGL Group, Inc. (2020 to present). Previously, Ms. Biles served as Vice President &amp; Controller of M-tron Industries, Inc. (2007 to 2024).</p>

			<p style="margin: 0pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</p>

