			<p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 8pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;"><sup style="vertical-align:top;line-height:120%;">(5)</sup></p>
			</td>
			<td style="width: 98%; font-size: 8pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif;">Mr. Nossokoff served as principal financial officer from April 16, 2024 to April 16, 2025, upon the appointment of Mr. Huvane as principal financial officer.</td>
