<p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt; text-align: left">&#160;</p>

<p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 12pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt;"><b><a id="Fees_Paid_to_Accting_Firm" title="Fees Paid to Accting Firm" href="#"></a>Fees Paid to Independent Registered Public Accounting Firm</b></p>

