			<p style="margin: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 8pt;"><sup style="vertical-align:top;line-height:120%;">(1)</sup></p>
			</td>
			<td style="width: 98%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">
			<p style="margin: 0pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 8pt;">The applicable percentage of ownership for each beneficial owner is based on 6,540,435&#160;shares of common stock outstanding as of March 31, 2026. Shares of common stock issuable upon exercise of options, warrants or other rights beneficially owned that are exercisable within 60 days are deemed outstanding for the purpose of computing the percentage ownership of the person holding such securities and rights.</p>
			</td>
		</tr>

</tbody></table>

<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%; text-indent: 0px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-right: 0pt; margin-bottom: 3pt; margin-left: 0pt;">

