			<td style="width: 98%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 8pt;">Mr. Lamb was appointed Chief Executive Officer on January 5, 2026.</td>
		</tr>

</tbody></table>

<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%; text-indent: 0px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-left: 0pt; margin-right: 0pt; margin-bottom: 3pt;">

		<tbody><tr style="vertical-align: top; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">
